  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At the center of the Blood Plain battlefield he fights Immortal Wang, who has transformed into a heaven swallowing hound. Chu Du judges that Immortal Wang is going to lose. Ye Lui Qun Xing keeps distance from the hound and answers with star fragment methods while Immortal Wang’s transformation spends itself on attacks.",
      "chapters": [
        1201
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_blood_plain",
        "char_immortal_wang",
        "char_chu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is tall and thin like a bamboo pole, has three strands of hair as a beard, and has a yellowish-white complexion.",
      "chapters": [
        1201
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Golden Dawn Hall’s gathering, Ye Lui Qun Xing fights Fang Yuan, who is disguised as Liu Guan Yi and transformed into an ancient sword dragon, sending out star fragments with immortal killer move myriad star fireflies that orbit him and build toward an overwhelming advantage. Believing a hundred star fragments already guard him, he does not expect ten thousand sword path dao marks and Sword Escape Immortal Gu to close the whole battlefield in an instant, and his final thought in life is disbelief that his star fragments’ flight paths could be seen through. Moments earlier, sure that a hundred star fragments make him safe, he had resolved to sustain the reputation of myriad star fireflies for the dead Dong Fang Chang Fan, whose guidance his immortal killer move had received.",
      "chapters": [
        1204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "duel-with-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_golden_dawn_hall",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_sword_escape_immortal_gu",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later draws out Ye Lui Qun Xing’s soul to break the soul path trap left in his own eight armed strength path immortal zombie body; the soul struggles and howls but is easily suppressed.",
      "chapters": [
        1445
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-spent-on-the-soul-path-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fed into the killer move alongside cleanse soul Immortal Gu over three days and three nights, it quietens and is worn away steadily as the immortal zombie body’s soul path dao marks decrease.",
      "chapters": [
        1446
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-spent-on-the-soul-path-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_cleanse_soul"
      ]
    }
